3802
04:06:32,620 --> 04:06:35,200
Outgrade the villagers of each profession to the max.

3803
04:06:36,380 --> 04:06:36,920
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

3804
04:06:37,120 --> 04:06:39,700
Go really far away and make a new home away from home, yeah.

3805
04:06:41,140 --> 04:06:42,080
Resummon the dragon.

3806
