3815
04:07:03,720 --> 04:07:05,060
Uh... Yeah, probably this one.

3816
04:07:06,960 --> 04:07:08,180
Maybe I'll bring the trident.

3817
04:07:10,460 --> 04:07:11,480
Is that a good idea?

3818
04:07:12,760 --> 04:07:13,880
Definitely need arrows.

3819
04:07:18,770 --> 04:07:24,110
And then I'm also gonna bring... Where are these thingies?

3820
04:07:25,270 --> 04:07:26,970
I forget what they're called.

3821
04:07:30,790 --> 04:07:36,810
And I have Ender... Ender... something.

3822
04:07:38,430 --> 04:07:39,450
And Crystal.

3823
04:07:40,410 --> 04:07:41,690
Okay, they look like that.

3824
04:07:41,910 --> 04:07:42,450
Did I make some?

3825
04:07:46,620 --> 04:07:51,060
And crystal... It's not down there.

3826
04:07:54,420 --> 04:07:58,660
Redstone... Hmm...

3827
04:08:05,100 --> 04:08:06,140
I don't know.

3828
04:08:06,460 --> 04:08:06,920
Maybe in here.

3829
04:08:08,340 --> 04:08:09,560
Oh, there they are.

3830
04:08:10,020 --> 04:08:10,620
Very nice.

3831
04:08:10,740 --> 04:08:11,660
I thought I did make some.

3832
04:08:12,260 --> 04:08:16,260
So, I'm gonna need to make, I think, at least like five more just to be safe.

3833
04:08:18,060 --> 04:08:20,860
I have ender, gas... Oh, was that the limiting factor?

3834
04:08:21,000 --> 04:08:21,840
Yes, it was.

3835
04:08:23,440 --> 04:08:23,800
Fuck.

3836
04:08:23,960 --> 04:08:24,360
Okay, you know what?

3837
04:08:24,440 --> 04:08:25,700
Fuck it, we're going now anyway.

3838
04:08:26,580 --> 04:08:27,480
We're gonna test it.

3839
04:08:29,260 --> 04:08:30,640
I may not have enough, but it's okay.

3840
04:08:30,820 --> 04:08:32,000
I have ender and glass.

3841
04:08:33,710 --> 04:08:34,990
I have that.

3842
04:08:35,530 --> 04:08:37,170
Now I need glass.

3843
04:08:38,870 --> 04:08:40,370
And crystal.

3844
04:08:41,250 --> 04:08:41,750
Eight.

3845
04:08:41,930 --> 04:08:42,170
Okay.

3846
04:08:42,950 --> 04:08:44,090
That's a decent amount.

3847
04:08:44,830 --> 04:08:46,290
I forget the amount of pillars there were.

3848
04:08:49,200 --> 04:08:51,560
Oh, but I actually have certain things I want to try in there.

3849
04:08:51,640 --> 04:08:52,500
There's multiple things I want to try.

3850
04:08:52,880 --> 04:08:54,220
We need to bring the head.

3851
04:08:57,000 --> 04:08:57,640
Dragon head.

3852
04:09:00,100 --> 04:09:05,500
And... I think... that's about... it.

3853
04:09:07,400 --> 04:09:08,780
Honestly, maybe 20 is a bit too much.

3854
04:09:09,020 --> 04:09:09,420
Bring 10.

3855
04:09:12,900 --> 04:09:14,280
It does take up space, right?

3856
04:09:17,310 --> 04:09:18,270
That actually fits in there.

3857
04:09:18,430 --> 04:09:18,690
Amazing.

3858
04:09:20,170 --> 04:09:20,910
I have Ender.

3859
04:09:24,730 --> 04:09:25,670
Let's have him there for now.

3860
04:09:28,190 --> 04:09:30,990
Now, in terms of food, we need all the food we can get.

3861
04:09:32,250 --> 04:09:37,450
The thing that's going to be really painful in there is this pickaxe is not upgraded at all.

3862
04:09:38,470 --> 04:09:41,670
And we're going to need a lot of ascension blocks, so let's just bring them from home.

3863
04:09:45,940 --> 04:09:47,240
Whatever blocks we can find.

3864
04:09:49,400 --> 04:09:50,120
Like stone.

3865
04:09:50,360 --> 04:09:52,280
Oh yeah, a bunch of cobblestone.

3866
04:09:54,440 --> 04:09:56,200
Maybe even have them in a shulker box.

3867
04:09:58,020 --> 04:09:58,940
Do I have an extra?

3868
04:10:02,220 --> 04:10:03,820
We're going to be using it as we go anyway.

3869
04:10:05,020 --> 04:10:08,360
The dirt is actually kind of useful.

3870
04:10:08,600 --> 04:10:09,420
I'll keep it at home.

3871
04:10:13,470 --> 04:10:15,330
Bloodstone, ender chest.

3872
04:10:15,730 --> 04:10:18,470
Ah, but I don't have silk touch.

3873
04:10:19,170 --> 04:10:20,210
Makes it useless.

3874
04:10:22,470 --> 04:10:23,670
Arrows, check.

3875
04:10:27,230 --> 04:10:27,850
Bed.

3876
04:10:30,190 --> 04:10:32,090
You could not sleep in there.

3877
04:10:33,170 --> 04:10:34,590
But I can sleep in front.

3878
04:10:36,030 --> 04:10:37,310
We have the sword.

3879
04:10:39,150 --> 04:10:41,190
Maybe I'll bring just a bit more arrow.

3880
04:10:44,220 --> 04:10:45,020
Okay.

3881
04:10:45,600 --> 04:10:46,500
We got the food.

3882
04:10:47,220 --> 04:10:50,700
And that's about it, I think.

3883
04:10:51,760 --> 04:10:53,600
There's nothing else I need.

3884
04:10:54,200 --> 04:10:55,520
Maybe I'll bring some signs.

3885
04:10:59,040 --> 04:11:01,260
Do I... Uh, hanging sign?

3886
04:11:02,400 --> 04:11:03,200
Nah.

3887
04:11:04,700 --> 04:11:05,920
Normal signs?

3888
04:11:07,220 --> 04:11:09,320
Takes one stick and wood.

3889
04:11:16,310 --> 04:11:16,950
There we go.

3890
04:11:17,330 --> 04:11:17,930
Bring those.

3891
04:11:20,750 --> 04:11:21,970
Shovel, we have an extra off.

3892
04:11:22,130 --> 04:11:22,990
Okay, I'm ready.

3893
04:11:24,370 --> 04:11:25,750
Alright, people, I'm off.

3894
04:11:25,970 --> 04:11:31,130
I'm about to go attempt to summon the dragon.

3895
04:11:32,150 --> 04:11:37,450
And if that fails, then we're... Oh, I'm also gonna need... No, I can get that there.

3896
04:11:38,450 --> 04:11:40,570
And if that fails... Oh, I need another shield.

3897
04:11:40,710 --> 04:11:40,910
Shit.

3898
04:11:42,440 --> 04:11:43,340
Shield, shield, shield.

3899
04:11:43,400 --> 04:11:44,640
This one is almost half done.

3900
04:11:45,620 --> 04:11:46,320
Can't have that.

3901
04:11:48,760 --> 04:11:49,640
Did I bring wood?

3902
04:11:49,800 --> 04:11:51,120
I didn't even bring wood, actually.

3903
04:11:51,260 --> 04:11:52,300
That's a huge mistake.

3904
04:11:53,180 --> 04:11:53,980
Keep that in there.

3905
04:11:55,800 --> 04:11:58,160
Let's make a shield out of iron.

3906
04:12:01,440 --> 04:12:02,020
Backup shield.

3907
04:12:02,440 --> 04:12:02,800
Nice.

3908
04:12:04,620 --> 04:12:04,980
Alright.

3909
04:12:06,220 --> 04:12:07,580
Oh, put the iron back.

3910
04:12:08,640 --> 04:12:11,260
No, actually, how much did I need for a shield?

3911
04:12:11,280 --> 04:12:11,940
Was it just a single?

3912
04:12:14,120 --> 04:12:14,680
It is.

3913
04:12:14,940 --> 04:12:18,160
So let's just have two of these with us.

3914
04:12:19,440 --> 04:12:20,960
In case we need to make a new one on the fly.

3915
04:12:23,480 --> 04:12:24,160
I like that.

3916
04:12:24,320 --> 04:12:26,500
Let's put this on now and leave this one at home.

3917
04:12:29,520 --> 04:12:30,640
Can always make more.

3918
04:12:32,660 --> 04:12:35,340
Shears... I may not need that, but whatever.

3919
04:12:37,440 --> 04:12:38,240
Alright, people!

3920
04:12:39,980 --> 04:12:40,680
I'm off.

3921
04:12:44,920 --> 04:12:46,380
I do remember the way as well.

3922
04:12:46,640 --> 04:12:47,560
Ah, but I need a boat.

3923
04:12:49,100 --> 04:12:50,280
That's what I wanted to craft.

3924
04:12:51,920 --> 04:12:57,300
An exploration boat, not docked at the bay, or at the... whatever it's called.

3925
04:12:57,460 --> 04:12:58,460
The dock, of course.

3926
04:12:59,500 --> 04:13:01,440
Boat, boat, boat, boat, boat requires wood.

3927
04:13:07,760 --> 04:13:08,280
Got it.

3928
04:13:14,070 --> 04:13:14,430
Nice.

3929
04:13:14,430 --> 04:13:14,790
Alrighty.

3930
04:13:15,110 --> 04:13:15,730
Oh, the glass.

3931
04:13:15,910 --> 04:13:16,250
What am I doing?

3932
04:13:20,750 --> 04:13:21,390
There we are.

3933
04:13:22,390 --> 04:13:24,030
And it's about to become night, so let's sleep.

3934
04:13:25,470 --> 04:13:26,790
Couldn't have been timed more perfectly.

3935
04:13:47,480 --> 04:13:48,180
Oh, no.

3936
04:13:48,440 --> 04:13:48,960
Wait, what?

3937
04:13:51,720 --> 04:13:53,860
What's the other... Ah, there it is.

3938
04:13:57,380 --> 04:13:58,180
Let's-a-go!

3939
04:13:58,480 --> 04:13:59,280
Oh, no.

3940
04:14:01,300 --> 04:14:02,460
That's very crimey.

3941
04:14:09,340 --> 04:14:10,100
Thank you.

3942
04:14:13,680 --> 04:14:14,420
I'll leave it.

3943
04:14:15,380 --> 04:14:16,440
I'll fix it in time.

3944
04:14:21,760 --> 04:14:22,620
Here we are.

3945
04:14:23,760 --> 04:14:26,360
So I think I remember exactly where I need to go.

3946
04:14:27,300 --> 04:14:32,980
It's quite close to the battleground where we fought Big W for the second time and made him our bitch.

3947
04:14:34,340 --> 04:14:36,320
If I can be so blunt, because that's what happened.

3948
04:14:36,660 --> 04:14:37,400
I mean, let's be real.

3949
04:14:37,980 --> 04:14:40,480
He stood no chance against the might of me.

3950
04:14:43,940 --> 04:14:45,040
It was so one-sided.

3951
04:14:45,280 --> 04:14:46,140
Oh god, don't look at that.

3952
04:14:59,290 --> 04:15:03,470
I want to make something like that in my village.

3953
04:15:03,990 --> 04:15:05,110
Something churchy.

3954
04:15:06,550 --> 04:15:11,610
You know, the priest godhouse needs to be more churchy.

3955
04:15:12,970 --> 04:15:14,270
Whoops, let's go this way.

3956
04:15:25,860 --> 04:15:26,760
So let me think.

3957
04:15:27,220 --> 04:15:32,520
I have two theories I can try regarding the summoning of the dragon.

3958
04:15:34,440 --> 04:15:40,060
One of them, in hindsight, may not be super good.

3959
04:15:41,800 --> 04:15:42,660
I'll try both.

3960
04:15:43,380 --> 04:15:49,120
I'm trying to think if there's other ways... Let me actually quickly look at the achievements again.

3961
04:15:54,610 --> 04:15:55,770
Respawn the ender dragon.

3962
04:15:56,830 --> 04:15:57,710
End crystal.

3963
04:16:01,450 --> 04:16:01,930
Okay.

3964
04:16:03,710 --> 04:16:05,090
It has no other hints.

3965
04:16:06,110 --> 04:16:07,290
Except the end crystal.

3966
04:16:13,790 --> 04:16:15,370
Actually, there's three things I can try.

3967
04:16:19,030 --> 04:16:20,850
I hope I'm going the right way here.

3968
04:16:24,680 --> 04:16:26,340
Did I have to go on land at some point?

3969
04:16:26,540 --> 04:16:27,660
Nah, wait, there's water over here.

3970
04:16:29,780 --> 04:16:30,580
Wait, is this it?

3971
04:16:30,720 --> 04:16:33,420
Am I... No.

3972
04:16:35,360 --> 04:16:35,940
Not yet.

3973
04:16:37,860 --> 04:16:39,540
I haven't found the battleground yet.

3974
04:16:50,030 --> 04:16:51,750
Actually, there's four things I can try.

3975
04:16:51,870 --> 04:16:52,530
I just had another idea.

3976
04:16:53,870 --> 04:16:59,330
I think there's a 75% chance I'm gonna summon the dragon.

3977
04:17:02,330 --> 04:17:05,550
I estimate that to be pretty high, actually.

3978
04:17:09,280 --> 04:17:14,760
Without killing it, I could imagine that the dragon will become more powerful the second time around.

3979
04:17:15,000 --> 04:17:15,740
That's another thing.

3980
04:17:16,860 --> 04:17:17,740
Maybe, maybe not.

3981
04:17:17,880 --> 04:17:20,320
It wouldn't make sense to have it be the exact same one, would it?

3982
04:17:21,500 --> 04:17:22,700
Like a New Game Plus?

3983
04:17:24,000 --> 04:17:26,280
You wouldn't have the same difficulty enemies.

3984
04:17:28,240 --> 04:17:29,920
Wait, where am I going?

3985
04:17:31,580 --> 04:17:33,380
Oh, actually, yeah, this is the way, this is the way.

3986
04:17:35,580 --> 04:17:39,720
So right over here, we're gonna have the battleground on the right, if I'm not mistaken.

3987
04:17:40,080 --> 04:17:44,820
Then on the left, we're gonna have a big old flat area.

3988
04:17:47,760 --> 04:17:48,540
Oh, come on.

3989
04:17:59,480 --> 04:18:00,240
I'm lost.

3990
04:18:01,280 --> 04:18:02,060
Oh, fuck.

3991
04:18:02,180 --> 04:18:02,780
Did I overshoot?

3992
04:18:04,960 --> 04:18:05,680
Oh, no.

3993
04:18:09,500 --> 04:18:16,900
No, no, it's definitely... Over... Shit, why didn't I bring... Goddamn.

3994
04:18:18,520 --> 04:18:19,920
Ah, I should have brought the ice.

3995
04:18:21,220 --> 04:18:21,700
Crap!

3996
04:18:24,340 --> 04:18:25,700
No, it's definitely over here.

3997
04:18:48,170 --> 04:18:49,930
This has to be it.

3998
04:18:54,530 --> 04:18:59,930
Now, there's also a tower close to the spot, to the north.

3999
04:19:11,470 --> 04:19:12,070
Motherfucker.

4000
04:19:17,050 --> 04:19:20,790
Dude, am I... I could have sworn it was here.

4001
04:19:24,470 --> 04:19:25,110
What?

4002
04:19:29,090 --> 04:19:30,050
Oh, what?

4003
04:19:32,170 --> 04:19:33,010
Oh, no.

4004
04:19:33,850 --> 04:19:35,330
It was further along.

4005
04:19:36,530 --> 04:19:37,570
I'm tripping.

4006
04:19:39,570 --> 04:19:41,250
Oh, look at this tall grass!

4007
04:19:45,800 --> 04:19:51,520
Where's my... Why is it called short when it's tall?

4008
04:19:53,000 --> 04:19:53,640
Huh?

4009
04:19:55,900 --> 04:19:56,960
What is this?

4010
04:19:59,880 --> 04:20:01,720
That is definitely tall grass.

4011
04:20:06,610 --> 04:20:07,010
Okay.

4012
04:20:08,190 --> 04:20:08,790
You know what?

4013
04:20:08,810 --> 04:20:09,790
I should have just trusted myself.

4014
04:20:10,010 --> 04:20:10,970
I know exactly where it is.

4015
04:20:11,050 --> 04:20:11,910
I shouldn't have gone back.

4016
04:20:12,050 --> 04:20:13,690
I should have just kept going on.

4017
04:20:15,770 --> 04:20:16,170
Yeah.

4018
04:20:16,410 --> 04:20:17,530
I should have trusted my gut.

4019
04:20:18,730 --> 04:20:22,290
Instead, I tried to think logically, and this is where it got me.

4020
04:20:24,790 --> 04:20:26,270
Let that be a lesson to you, people.

4021
04:20:26,950 --> 04:20:28,050
Trust your gut instinct.

4022
04:20:37,610 --> 04:20:38,210
Let's go.

4023
04:20:38,430 --> 04:20:39,390
Also eat some steak.

4024
04:20:47,190 --> 04:20:48,230
So now we're back here.

4025
04:20:50,330 --> 04:20:52,310
It's just that I feel like it was way closer.

4026
04:20:53,430 --> 04:20:55,970
But... I was wrong.

4027
04:20:57,910 --> 04:20:59,530
I gotta go past that village then.

4028
04:21:01,490 --> 04:21:08,350
Unless I went on land... and then traversed over that and then went on to... water again.

4029
04:21:09,390 --> 04:21:11,770
Because early on I did have the option to go on land.

4030
04:21:11,950 --> 04:21:12,510
But no, no, no.

4031
04:21:12,590 --> 04:21:14,750
There was definitely a boating session all the way.

4032
04:21:16,460 --> 04:21:20,340
Adrian was there for the entirety of that trip, I remember.

4033
04:21:29,500 --> 04:21:34,000
Yeah, just... Trust... Trust the gut.

4034
04:21:43,600 --> 04:21:44,600
Hey, Salmon.

4035
04:21:52,000 --> 04:21:52,780
What is that?

4036
04:21:59,720 --> 04:22:00,480
It's a fern.

4037
04:22:02,080 --> 04:22:03,360
Why is it so big?

4038
04:22:10,200 --> 04:22:18,840
Maybe I'll have a room in the village where I will have two ferns, a couple chairs in between, and I will just randomly interview some of the villagers.

4039
04:22:23,740 --> 04:22:24,760
That could be a thing.

4040
04:22:27,320 --> 04:22:30,660
So this right here is not pleasing me right now.

4041
04:22:31,340 --> 04:22:33,520
What is going on with this weird-ass village?

4042
04:22:35,540 --> 04:22:38,220
I have zero knowledge of this.

4043
04:22:41,280 --> 04:22:41,860
What?

4044
04:22:44,980 --> 04:22:46,740
My gut says this way.

4045
04:22:57,790 --> 04:22:58,670
Which way is home?

4046
04:23:00,550 --> 04:23:01,270
Of course.

4047
04:23:02,930 --> 04:23:08,770
