Or do I?

4314
04:40:58,470 --> 04:40:59,990
Because I already made a bunch of bridges.

4315
04:41:01,330 --> 04:41:02,670
I should utilize those.

4316
04:41:04,470 --> 04:41:05,950
Let's also have food at the ready.

4317
04:41:07,350 --> 04:41:08,510
This guy at the ready.

4318
04:41:17,260 --> 04:41:18,720
Sorry, my stomach is growling.

4319
04:41:21,660 --> 04:41:24,620
So, wait, I didn't make a bridge here.

4320
04:41:27,700 --> 04:41:28,220
What the?

4321
04:41:28,420 --> 04:41:29,620
So I guess I didn't go this way.

4322
04:41:30,800 --> 04:41:32,220
Maybe I will go this way now, though.

4323
04:41:35,240 --> 04:41:36,600
Let me also check over here.

4324
04:41:37,800 --> 04:41:39,340
Don't see a bridge over there.

4325
04:41:40,500 --> 04:41:41,720
I'm gonna go this way now, then.

4326
04:41:42,040 --> 04:41:43,500
We're going a completely new path.

4327
04:42:06,190 --> 04:42:07,970
I think I want to turn left at some point.

4328
04:42:20,850 --> 04:42:23,610
Okay, new... Use one of these.

4329
04:42:24,410 --> 04:42:25,730
Just get it out of my inventory.

4330
04:42:27,430 --> 04:42:28,890
And now...

4331
04:42:37,000 --> 04:42:38,540
Now we go a little bit like this.

4332
04:42:44,100 --> 04:42:46,600
This does feel like a waste of blocks, though, when you do it like that.

4333
04:42:49,160 --> 04:42:51,300
But I guess in the end, you're gonna end up using the same amount.

4334
04:42:54,180 --> 04:42:54,500
Wait.

4335
04:42:55,020 --> 04:42:56,520
Oh, I just hit a weird island.

4336
04:42:59,540 --> 04:43:01,220
I can fall down here.

4337
04:43:03,140 --> 04:43:04,800
Ah, I need that fruit.

4338
04:43:06,800 --> 04:43:10,400
I need to get the fruit.

4339
04:43:13,680 --> 04:43:15,200
The fruit of my loins.

4340
04:43:15,860 --> 04:43:17,380
Not actually sure what that means.

4341
04:43:17,840 --> 04:43:18,840
I've heard it before.

4342
04:43:22,220 --> 04:43:23,380
I'm gonna take this.

4343
04:43:26,000 --> 04:43:26,720
Thank you.

4344
04:43:28,960 --> 04:43:30,280
There's so many of these guys.

4345
04:43:30,580 --> 04:43:33,820
I need to be ultra ready to create an on-the-spot EDP.

4346
04:43:38,140 --> 04:43:39,820
In case shit hits the fan.

4347
04:43:41,280 --> 04:43:43,100
Sometimes they aggro for no reason.

4348
04:43:43,640 --> 04:43:45,080
I gotta be ready for this.

4349
04:43:48,440 --> 04:43:49,300
Don't follow me.

4350
04:44:03,340 --> 04:44:04,320
Oh my god.

4351
04:44:07,200 --> 04:44:08,040
Is that new?

4352
04:44:09,000 --> 04:44:11,000
Or is that the same that I've already explored?

4353
04:44:13,780 --> 04:44:15,540
It has to be one I've already been in, right?

4354
04:44:16,780 --> 04:44:17,640
Also, what the hell?

4355
04:44:22,340 --> 04:44:23,260
Making bridge over here.

4356
04:44:29,950 --> 04:44:34,730
I'm so scared of my pinky slipping on the control key.

4357
04:44:36,470 --> 04:44:40,150
It's a legit huge fear I have when I do these weird bridges.

4358
04:44:46,810 --> 04:44:47,870
I need more fruit.

4359
04:44:51,310 --> 04:44:52,990
I may as well eat those for food.

4360
04:45:02,940 --> 04:45:04,440
I think I've already been over there.

4361
04:45:08,080 --> 04:45:08,760
Are you angry?

4362
04:45:10,660 --> 04:45:11,780
Don't be angry at me, please.

4363
04:45:14,320 --> 04:45:14,960
Oh, nice.

4364
04:45:15,040 --> 04:45:15,520
It connects here.

4365
04:45:15,600 --> 04:45:16,080
That's wonderful.

4366
04:45:20,950 --> 04:45:26,690
Man, I wonder what it... So, Minecraft definitely has a size limit, you know?

4367
04:45:27,030 --> 04:45:28,090
It's not infinite.

4368
04:45:29,370 --> 04:45:33,430
What would it even look like if I went to the very, very edge of the game?

4369
04:45:35,110 --> 04:45:36,030
Think about that.

4370
04:45:37,490 --> 04:45:39,650
Like, invisible wall, I guess?

4371
04:45:40,210 --> 04:45:42,130
Like, it just stops generating?

4372
04:45:42,350 --> 04:45:44,730
It's just the... I don't know.

4373
04:45:48,820 --> 04:45:50,220
That is a question, isn't it?

4374
04:45:52,080 --> 04:45:54,420
One day I'm going to answer that question, somehow.

4375
04:45:55,420 --> 04:45:56,300
Mark my words.

4376
04:45:56,840 --> 04:45:59,580
One day I will find a method to get to the very end.

4377
04:46:00,480 --> 04:46:01,820
And see what's going on.

4378
04:46:04,280 --> 04:46:09,460
And maybe that's the day when I decide that I've seen everything there is in Minecraft.

4379
04:46:11,660 --> 04:46:12,980
It may be years from now.

4380
04:46:16,550 --> 04:46:18,270
It's fine, it's just sounds.

4381
04:46:19,250 --> 04:46:20,130
No big deal.

4382
04:46:25,450 --> 04:46:28,290
There's no floating ship, which is kind of a bummer.

4383
04:46:32,950 --> 04:46:33,430
Also...

4384
04:46:37,080 --> 04:46:37,940
No endermen.

4385
04:46:38,420 --> 04:46:39,420
Like, at all.

4386
04:46:41,780 --> 04:46:42,220
Weird.

4387
04:46:43,600 --> 04:46:49,940
I guess I'm going... I wonder if it would be cheaper for me to go straight like that, or like, go along like that.

4388
04:46:54,260 --> 04:46:55,000
Wait, what's that?

4389
04:46:55,480 --> 04:46:56,220
Oh, okay.

4390
04:46:57,360 --> 04:46:58,740
Fuck it, I'm going straight across.

4391
04:47:12,300 --> 04:47:13,360
Why is it so slow now?

4392
04:47:13,760 --> 04:47:15,380
Okay, I found a better angle of the mouse.

4393
04:47:17,120 --> 04:47:19,720
You can get it just right where it feels really fast, like now.

4394
04:47:21,020 --> 04:47:24,980
That was perfect.

4395
04:47:25,400 --> 04:47:26,500
The other ones are not perfect.

4396
04:47:27,140 --> 04:47:30,200
If I just spam the button, it's actually worse.

4397
04:47:43,830 --> 04:47:45,550
I think I'm not even halfway across.

4398
04:47:52,830 --> 04:47:53,730
Oh, okay!

4399
04:47:54,090 --> 04:47:54,870
Closer than I thought.

4400
04:47:55,530 --> 04:47:56,130
Nice.

4401
04:48:12,570 --> 04:48:13,770
And... almost.

4402
04:48:23,850 --> 04:48:24,830
There we are.

4403
04:48:27,250 --> 04:48:29,610
Oh man, there's so many endermen here now suddenly.

4404
04:48:33,390 --> 04:48:36,010
Are we gonna have... enemies?

4405
04:48:38,110 --> 04:48:39,290
Enemies on the walls?

4406
04:48:46,720 --> 04:48:47,660
There's no door!

4407
04:48:48,060 --> 04:48:49,180
What the hell is this?

4408
04:48:56,240 --> 04:48:56,760
Boom.

4409
04:48:57,880 --> 04:48:58,660
Hammer time.

4410
04:48:59,300 --> 04:49:00,200
Hammer does nothing.

4411
04:49:01,620 --> 04:49:02,400
Oh, no.

4412
04:49:02,800 --> 04:49:03,960
No, no, no, no.

4413
04:49:04,180 --> 04:49:04,760
Stop that.

4414
04:49:07,080 --> 04:49:09,180
Not... Oh, what the... Oh!

4415
04:49:09,440 --> 04:49:10,380
I thought it was a... I see.

4416
04:49:10,780 --> 04:49:11,240
I understand.

4417
04:49:17,680 --> 04:49:19,120
How did I ever struggle with these?

4418
04:49:20,580 --> 04:49:21,300
They're a joke.

4419
04:49:22,300 --> 04:49:22,900
Like, what?

4420
04:49:27,360 --> 04:49:28,300
I just had an idea.

4421
04:49:30,420 --> 04:49:31,420
A really good idea.

4422
04:49:33,080 --> 04:49:33,840
Check this out.

4423
04:49:42,200 --> 04:49:43,460
I'm the slap man.

4424
04:49:47,440 --> 04:49:49,300
I'm gonna get so much.

4425
04:49:49,500 --> 04:49:50,160
Dude, for bridges!

4426
04:49:52,920 --> 04:49:55,120
I was like, I can use it here, but bridging!

4427
04:49:56,660 --> 04:49:57,560
With slabs!

4428
04:49:58,120 --> 04:49:58,840
Okay, you know what?

4429
04:49:59,880 --> 04:50:02,100
I'm sorry for all the times I've shit-talked slabs.

4430
04:50:02,280 --> 04:50:05,460
This is one case where it's useful.

4431
04:50:06,080 --> 04:50:07,540
I will grant them that.

4432
04:50:08,900 --> 04:50:10,220
I can see the potential.

4433
04:50:13,060 --> 04:50:15,520
It's double the effectiveness.

4434
04:50:17,060 --> 04:50:17,900
Very nice.

4435
04:50:21,160 --> 04:50:22,160
Give me that, please.

4436
04:50:24,120 --> 04:50:24,940
Thank you.

4437
04:50:30,080 --> 04:50:34,620
Okay, um... Look at this!

4438
04:50:34,760 --> 04:50:35,340
Oh, god.

4439
04:50:35,920 --> 04:50:36,540
Oh, no.

4440
04:50:39,280 --> 04:50:40,140
You know what?

4441
04:50:40,280 --> 04:50:41,120
What if I just...

4442
04:50:43,740 --> 04:50:44,940
That's too risky, isn't it?

4443
04:50:45,100 --> 04:50:45,920
That's way too risky.

4444
04:50:47,860 --> 04:50:51,820
I feel like that wouldn't be... No, I did the same mistake!

4445
04:50:53,980 --> 04:50:54,540
Fuck.

4446
04:50:55,060 --> 04:50:55,820
I'm so bad.

4447
04:50:58,360 --> 04:50:59,380
Jump to here.

4448
04:51:00,760 --> 04:51:01,620
Do that.

4449
04:51:01,960 --> 04:51:02,120
No.

4450
04:51:03,960 --> 04:51:06,180
Here, here, here.

4451
04:51:07,780 --> 04:51:09,180
And now we're rolling.

4452
04:51:10,420 --> 04:51:11,900
Oh, this is already like...

4453
04:51:11,910 --> 04:51:12,590
Pre-done?

4454
04:51:15,130 --> 04:51:16,330
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

4455
04:51:24,230 --> 04:51:24,790
Got him.

4456
04:51:26,850 --> 04:51:27,770
Where are the rest at?

4457
04:51:30,170 --> 04:51:30,930
I see you.

4458
04:51:32,410 --> 04:51:32,930
Got him.

4459
04:51:37,090 --> 04:51:37,770
Ah, it hit me.

4460
04:51:38,690 --> 04:51:39,030
Shit.

4461
04:51:39,630 --> 04:51:40,230
Get the food ready.

4462
04:51:41,970 --> 04:51:42,890
Why am I stuck here?

4463
04:51:42,930 --> 04:51:43,490
I can't move.

4464
04:51:44,770 --> 04:51:45,270
There we go.

4465
04:51:51,430 --> 04:51:52,170
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

4466
04:51:52,370 --> 04:51:52,910
Everything's fine.

4467
04:51:54,370 --> 04:51:55,190
Everything's under control.

4468
04:51:55,290 --> 04:51:55,670
I need these.

4469
04:51:56,270 --> 04:51:56,890
I need that.

4470
04:51:56,970 --> 04:51:57,290
I need that.

4471
04:52:01,800 --> 04:52:02,920
No, no, no, no.

4472
04:52:03,140 --> 04:52:03,960
Ah, damn it.

4473
04:52:04,600 --> 04:52:04,700
Okay.

4474
04:52:05,440 --> 04:52:06,060
It's fine.

4475
04:52:07,800 --> 04:52:08,420
We're chilling.

4476
04:52:12,240 --> 04:52:12,840
Thank you.

4477
04:52:13,720 --> 04:52:14,960
Those are very much needed.

4478
04:52:35,950 --> 04:52:49,470
Yeah, okay, for doing that, they're not very good, but... They're definitely good for the other reasons... 

4479
04:52:57,570 --> 04:53:00,230
Mending fire protection on... Bro.

4480
04:53:01,290 --> 04:53:01,850
Okay.

4481
04:53:03,950 --> 04:53:06,330
Ooh, that's a really good iron pickaxe.

4482
04:53:07,770 --> 04:53:09,330
Jesus Christ, brother.

4483
04:53:10,830 --> 04:53:11,790
Me likey.

4484
04:53:15,770 --> 04:53:17,290
And the pearl can go in here, too.

4485
04:53:17,910 --> 04:53:20,990
And give me that one, and the rest I don't care about.

4486
04:53:23,170 --> 04:53:24,630
Very nice loot here.

4487
04:53:30,600 --> 04:53:31,700
We made it up here.

4488
04:53:35,400 --> 04:53:36,840
Let's figure out where we came from.

4489
04:53:38,260 --> 04:53:39,080
Where's my bridge?

4490
04:53:44,340 --> 04:53:44,820
There.

4491
04:53:47,720 --> 04:53:48,200
Okay.

4492
04:53:50,220 --> 04:53:52,180
And I came from...

4493
04:53:56,710 --> 04:53:57,230
There.

4494
04:53:57,230 --> 04:53:59,930
I went like this, so I want to keep going that way.

4495
04:54:01,570 --> 04:54:03,990
Let's just... What the?

4496
04:54:05,290 --> 04:54:06,750
Why did you just do that?

4497
04:54:07,670 --> 04:54:08,950
I just shot out a laser.

4498
04:54:23,550 --> 04:54:26,130
Not seeing anything out of the ordinary here.

4499
04:54:32,090 --> 04:54:32,710
Okay.

4500
04:54:33,130 --> 04:54:34,310
I'm gonna go this direction.

4501
04:54:37,630 --> 04:54:38,850
Let's eat the fruit.

4502
04:54:44,650 --> 04:54:45,130
Nice.

4503
04:54:48,030 --> 04:54:50,670
Dude, actually, this fruit is so useful to have.

4504
04:54:51,590 --> 04:54:52,270
OH NO!

4505
04:55:22,210 --> 04:55:22,930
Come to me!

4506
04:55:29,310 --> 04:55:30,330
Oh, you can't get in.

4507
04:55:31,350 --> 04:55:32,150
Here, let me help you.

4508
04:55:35,020 --> 04:55:35,560
Come on now.

4509
04:55:37,160 --> 04:55:37,700
There we are.

4510
04:55:37,760 --> 04:55:38,240
There we are.

4511
04:55:38,460 --> 04:55:39,000
That's it.

4512
04:55:39,100 --> 04:55:39,380
That's it.

4513
04:55:39,460 --> 04:55:39,760
That's it.

4514
04:55:42,340 --> 04:55:42,820
That's it.

4515
04:55:43,300 --> 04:55:43,620
Yes.

4516
04:55:45,500 --> 04:55:46,260
Oh, I hate them.

4517
04:55:51,880 --> 04:55:52,600
What are they doing?

4518
04:56:13,130 --> 04:56:13,970
I know that's more.

4519
04:56:17,730 --> 04:56:18,130
No?

4520
04:56:19,650 --> 04:56:20,510
Wasn't there a third?

4521
04:56:24,750 --> 04:56:25,390
I'm scared.

4522
04:56:27,890 --> 04:56:29,350
I forgot which way I came from now.

4523
04:56:30,510 --> 04:56:31,630
There, shall we go this way?

4524
04:56:32,570 --> 04:56:33,430
Oh, man.

4525
04:56:33,610 --> 04:56:36,850
Is he gonna pop out out of nowhere and bust me off my bridge?

4526
04:56:41,170 --> 04:56:42,470
No, what's that?

4527
04:56:43,250 --> 04:56:43,630
Oh.

4528
04:56:46,790 --> 04:56:47,170
Okay.

4529
04:56:50,050 --> 04:56:50,650
I'm scared.

4530
04:56:50,750 --> 04:56:51,890
Is he gonna pop out out of nowhere?

4531
04:56:53,510 --> 04:56:55,010
He would have been on me right now, though.

4532
04:57:03,110 --> 04:57:03,870
Be good to me.

4533
04:57:29,340 --> 04:57:30,260
Oh, right.

4534
04:57:38,400 --> 04:57:41,300
I am clenching right now.

4535
04:57:44,260 --> 04:57:52,740
I'm so afraid that the Enderman will pop out out of nowhere and push me off this bridge to my death.

4536
04:58:03,920 --> 04:58:04,720
Okay.

4537
04:58:05,240 --> 04:58:06,520
I feel better now.

4538
04:58:11,300 --> 04:58:12,920
Okay, there we are.

4539
04:58:16,780 --> 04:58:18,200
Scary stuff, that.

4540
04:58:24,050 --> 04:58:28,530
Let's just keep wandering in this eternal hellscape.

4541
04:58:30,750 --> 04:58:31,990
Actually, that's not even appropriate.

4542
04:58:31,990 --> 04:58:34,210
I feel like the nether is the hellscape.

4543
04:58:34,350 --> 04:58:35,570
I don't know what you would call this.

4544
04:58:39,390 --> 04:58:42,290
You know what this place reminds me of?

4545
04:58:43,670 --> 04:58:45,370
It reminds me of nothing.

4546
04:58:46,190 --> 04:58:53,950
Which is one of the... I think I may have explained this once before, but... I recently had the same experience again while sitting at home in my couch.

4547
04:58:55,990 --> 04:58:57,210
Imagine... nothing.

4548
04:58:57,770 --> 04:59:00,090
And I mean... absolutely nothing.

4549
04:59:01,910 --> 04:59:05,430
Think about the fact that we're all here... as humans.

4550
04:59:05,850 --> 04:59:06,330
Living.

4551
04:59:07,000 --> 04:59:08,000
In this universe.

4552
04:59:09,820 --> 04:59:12,680
But... What if that didn't exist at all?

4553
04:59:12,880 --> 04:59:14,780
Why is there even a universe to begin with?

4554
04:59:16,100 --> 04:59:17,380
Why isn't there just nothing?

4555
04:59:19,400 --> 04:59:22,060
Isn't it super weird that we're actually here?

4556
04:59:23,760 --> 04:59:24,760
In the first place.

4557
04:59:24,900 --> 04:59:26,120
Why is the universe the way it is?

4558
04:59:26,160 --> 04:59:26,940
And why is it right here?

4559
04:59:29,380 --> 04:59:32,920
If there was absolutely nothing in... Like, out there.

4560
04:59:33,000 --> 04:59:34,380
If you could even say there wasn't out there.

4561
04:59:34,830 --> 04:59:43,190
If there is nothing out there, and there never was anything out there, you would never have been born, you would never have had any, like, experiences.

4562
04:59:43,750 --> 04:59:45,290
That's what this place reminds me of.

4563
04:59:45,950 --> 04:59:46,390
Nothingness.

4564
04:59:47,150 --> 04:59:48,110
There's nothing here.

4565
04:59:50,550 --> 04:59:52,650
It's as if nothing ever came into being.

4566
04:59:53,010 --> 04:59:53,910
You know what I mean?

4567
04:59:54,770 --> 05:00:02,790
And when you think about that, I said about that the other day in my couch, right, and thought about that, really tried to imagine nothing.

4568
05:00:03,650 --> 05:00:06,170
That is one of the most scary things ever.

4569
05:00:06,850 --> 05:00:12,830
Like, my heart drops down into the pit of my stomach, you know, when I think about it like that.

4570
05:00:14,970 --> 05:00:16,330
It's a weird feeling.

4571
05:00:18,590 --> 05:00:24,210
One of the few feelings in life or thoughts that actually give me pause and make me go, wow.

4572
05:00:24,910 --> 05:00:26,950
I almost get dizzy thinking about that.

4573
05:00:32,520 --> 05:00:36,280
I cannot believe I realized this many hours in.

4574
05:00:36,840 --> 05:00:39,680
Making britches out of slabs is smart.

4575
05:00:40,540 --> 05:00:42,420
How many hours have I played this game?

4576
05:00:43,860 --> 05:00:45,180
Like, what the hell?

4577
05:00:47,360 --> 05:00:49,620
It's obvious in hindsight.

4578
05:00:51,600 --> 05:00:53,080
God damn it, man.

4579
05:00:55,380 --> 05:00:57,120
It's like double the efficiency.

4580
05:01:00,120 --> 05:01:04,060
I will say, though, it's a little bit jankier making bridges.

4581
