5415
06:00:24,840 --> 06:00:26,640
My machine works, dammit.

5416
06:00:27,380 --> 06:00:28,580
I nailed it.

5417
06:00:28,960 --> 06:00:30,660
I freaking nailed it.

5418
06:00:32,060 --> 06:00:34,140
And it's not even its final form.

5419
06:00:35,800 --> 06:00:37,560
It's not even its final form.

5420
06:00:37,660 --> 06:00:38,260
I'm not done.

5421
06:00:39,300 --> 06:00:40,860
It can still be improved.

5422
06:00:42,260 --> 06:00:42,860
Incredible.

5423
06:00:43,220 --> 06:00:44,780
I'm so happy to be wrong there.

5424
06:00:45,740 --> 06:00:47,300
I'm so happy to be wrong.

5425
06:00:48,780 --> 06:00:50,580
So the winner is definitely the third option.

5426
06:00:50,720 --> 06:00:51,220
30 plus.

5427
06:00:53,420 --> 06:00:54,600
Gunpowder brother, man.

5428
06:00:54,780 --> 06:00:57,940
We can make so many TNTs soon.

5429
06:00:59,060 --> 06:01:00,160
Oh, don't put these in here.

5430
06:01:01,080 --> 06:01:02,300
