5436
06:01:11,460 --> 06:01:12,000
Like this.

5437
06:01:12,200 --> 06:01:14,840
So I can have a bit of extra when I pick them up when I kill skeletons, right?

5438
06:01:16,200 --> 06:01:16,560
Bones.

5439
06:01:17,580 --> 06:01:17,940
Shears?

5440
06:01:18,040 --> 06:01:18,800
I don't need shears right now.

5441
06:01:19,160 --> 06:01:19,900
Fuck the shears.

5442
06:01:20,580 --> 06:01:21,480
Don't care about shears.

5443
