Okay, I'll get the pink bed, then.

5452
06:01:43,620 --> 06:01:43,900
Fine.

5453
06:01:49,160 --> 06:01:49,900
Okay, then.

5454
06:01:50,260 --> 06:01:51,520
Oh, look at that chimney.

5455
06:01:51,740 --> 06:01:52,800
My chimney's working.

5456
06:01:53,500 --> 06:01:53,620
Why?

5457
06:01:53,860 --> 06:01:57,540
I hate this darkened... See, another thing about the slabs.

5458
06:01:57,700 --> 06:01:59,400
I don't have that issue with stairs.

5459
06:02:00,200 --> 06:02:01,360
There's a darkened... Yeah.

5460
06:02:02,120 --> 06:02:03,480
I'm fixing that next time.

5461
06:02:04,440 --> 06:02:04,960
100%.

5462
06:02:04,960 --> 06:02:12,540
But right now... It's Operation Find Erika and Find... I Know A Guy.

5463
06:02:13,260 --> 06:02:15,040
This is the Operation I Know A Guy.

5464
06:02:15,360 --> 06:02:16,200
He's downstairs.

5465
