5501
06:04:39,210 --> 06:04:43,170
You wouldn't get the loot, but that's a fair trade-off when you get a huge explosion exactly where you want it.

5502
06:04:49,130 --> 06:04:49,510
Diamonds?

5503
06:04:50,310 --> 06:04:51,070
I'll take those.

5504
06:04:58,250 --> 06:04:58,630
Spiders?

5505
06:05:00,910 --> 06:05:01,290
Where?

5506
06:05:10,920 --> 06:05:16,060
Now, the guy I know is somewhere in these... tunnels.

5507
06:05:17,960 --> 06:05:19,320
The spider's over here somewhere.

5508
06:05:21,840 --> 06:05:24,140
Oh, would you look at that!

5509
06:05:33,280 --> 06:05:33,820
Boom.

5510
06:05:39,340 --> 06:05:40,460
There's a spawner over there.

5511
06:05:51,900 --> 06:05:52,720
I'm gonna leave it.

5512
06:05:56,220 --> 06:05:59,540
Bro, I actually cringe thinking about all the times I destroyed those now.

5513
06:06:00,360 --> 06:06:07,180
In hindsight, you know, all the possibilities... I mean, obviously I didn't know that at the time, but... I'm saying now, right?

5514
06:06:14,500 --> 06:06:15,840
Where was this guy I knew?

5515
06:06:20,100 --> 06:06:21,800
I think he was over here, to be honest.

5516
06:06:28,940 --> 06:06:30,320
Somewhere in these tunnels.

5517
06:06:30,920 --> 06:06:32,520
Oh, did I... I must have looted this one, though.

5518
06:06:34,060 --> 06:06:34,460
Yeah.

5519
06:06:34,960 --> 06:06:35,720
