5521
06:06:41,750 --> 06:06:51,230
I gotta be honest, guys, seeing all those goodie bags in the Orphan Crusher made me really motivated to keep doing this stuff I'm doing down here.

5522
06:06:54,870 --> 06:06:55,710
Nametag, yeah!

5523
06:06:56,530 --> 06:06:59,090
Torches, I love those, especially right now.

5524
