5538
06:08:17,650 --> 06:08:19,170
I lost Erika around here.

5539
06:08:20,870 --> 06:08:25,610
In fact, I'm going to predict I'll find Erika in the next six minutes.

5540
06:08:27,490 --> 06:08:28,630
Whoa, she's had a lag spike.

5541
06:08:29,190 --> 06:08:30,070
Huge lag spike.

5542
06:08:35,620 --> 06:08:36,760
Light that up.

5543
06:08:37,220 --> 06:08:38,120
By the way, listen.

5544
06:08:41,080 --> 06:08:42,100
No enemies.

5545
06:08:42,440 --> 06:08:45,200
This entire cave is frickin' cleansed.

5546
06:08:54,140 --> 06:08:57,160
There's darkness over there, but I don't see any enemies for some reason.

5547
06:08:57,840 --> 06:08:58,260
