5561
06:09:46,160 --> 06:09:47,460
Thanks for pointing that out to me, dude.

5562
06:09:48,780 --> 06:09:49,600
I appreciate.

5563
06:10:00,460 --> 06:10:01,080
EDP.

5564
06:10:03,040 --> 06:10:03,980
Basic EDP.

5565
06:10:08,960 --> 06:10:10,020
You can hit me, huh?

5566
06:10:13,200 --> 06:10:14,620
Also see enemies down there.

5567
06:10:21,180 --> 06:10:21,800
Nice.

5568
06:10:22,320 --> 06:10:23,040
Got the pearl.

5569
06:10:26,020 --> 06:10:26,980
Light that up.

5570
06:10:28,720 --> 06:10:30,620
Maybe also, like, there.

5571
06:10:31,220 --> 06:10:33,460
You know, just a little bit of light.

5572
06:10:38,680 --> 06:10:40,540
Ah, it's also too dark over there, I see.

5573
06:10:41,280 --> 06:10:42,700
Man, I missed a couple spots, huh?

5574
06:10:45,880 --> 06:10:47,100
This wasn't super thorough.

5575
06:10:50,820 --> 06:10:53,060
I think this place is thoroughly lit.

5576
06:10:56,490 --> 06:10:57,250
Everything is good.

5577
06:11:01,230 --> 06:11:02,510
That's also lit up there.

5578
06:11:03,890 --> 06:11:04,490
Everything's good.

5579
06:11:11,380 --> 06:11:13,260
Dude, tell me that was exactly six minutes.

5580
06:11:14,180 --> 06:11:15,180
There you are, buddy!

5581
06:11:15,820 --> 06:11:16,520
What's up, Erika?

5582
06:11:17,460 --> 06:11:18,420
You're with me again.

5583
06:11:20,120 --> 06:11:25,100
Tell me that was exactly... Either someone calculates that, or I will later.

5584
06:11:26,800 --> 06:11:28,280
That felt like six minutes!

5585
06:11:33,080 --> 06:11:33,560
Okay!

5586
06:11:35,260 --> 06:11:36,940
