5602
06:12:27,360 --> 06:12:28,820
I'm definitely getting in there.

5603
06:12:31,460 --> 06:12:32,720
Erika, follow me.

5604
06:12:33,280 --> 06:12:34,760
We're going into battle.

5605
06:12:36,580 --> 06:12:38,900
I require your strongest lotion.

5606
06:12:40,260 --> 06:12:41,900
Oh shit, there's an enderman too.

5607
