Hey guys, come to me.

5610
06:12:49,780 --> 06:12:50,320
Get him, Erika!

5611
06:12:50,780 --> 06:12:51,280
Yes!

5612
06:13:00,280 --> 06:13:00,780
Nice!

5613
06:13:00,780 --> 06:13:01,460
Good job.

5614
06:13:06,060 --> 06:13:08,440
Okay, this is definitely a problematic area.

5615
06:13:08,700 --> 06:13:09,320
Why is there somebody in the middle?

5616
06:13:12,640 --> 06:13:13,420
Don't look at him.

5617
06:13:17,020 --> 06:13:17,840
Goddamn, dude.

5618
06:13:19,220 --> 06:13:20,000
EDP time.

5619
06:13:28,180 --> 06:13:28,920
Get America.

5620
06:13:31,860 --> 06:13:32,880
Are they hitting my dog?

5621
06:13:41,580 --> 06:13:42,600
Shit, shit, shit.

5622
06:13:48,680 --> 06:13:50,240
Did he just steal some gravel?

5623
06:13:53,280 --> 06:13:56,500
He almost caused a cave-in mid-fight on his own.

5624
06:14:08,890 --> 06:14:09,830
Okay, that was nice.

5625
06:14:10,030 --> 06:14:10,790
I hear skeletons still.

5626
06:14:13,430 --> 06:14:14,230
Somewhere in here.

5627
06:14:17,050 --> 06:14:17,470
Here.

5628
06:14:20,950 --> 06:14:24,390
Now, I'm definitely not going in the right direction to find the dude I know.

5629
06:14:27,350 --> 06:14:29,070
But, you know, I'm having a good time here.

5630
06:14:29,170 --> 06:14:31,990
Just clearing out these... Oh, yeah!

5631
06:14:32,490 --> 06:14:33,530
Look at this place.

5632
06:14:36,090 --> 06:14:37,110
This makes me happy.

5633
06:14:43,520 --> 06:14:44,620
Oh, I don't have infinite ammo.

5634
06:14:44,700 --> 06:14:45,400
Let's keep that in mind.

5635
06:15:07,120 --> 06:15:07,800
Hey!

5636
06:15:07,800 --> 06:15:09,620
Where did you come from?

5637
06:15:09,960 --> 06:15:10,520
Probably over here.

5638
06:15:12,920 --> 06:15:13,600
Hello.

5639
06:15:18,700 --> 06:15:19,380
Greetings!

5640
06:15:21,120 --> 06:15:22,440
I feel like I'm unstoppable.

5641
06:15:22,820 --> 06:15:23,360
Three Elytras?

5642
06:15:23,740 --> 06:15:25,520
And I'm killing it right now.

5643
06:15:27,240 --> 06:15:28,340
I'm peeking.

5644
06:15:35,240 --> 06:15:35,900
Jump across.

5645
06:15:37,420 --> 06:15:38,060
Light it up.

5646
06:15:39,920 --> 06:15:41,720
Make him kill the fucking... Okay.

5647
06:15:42,300 --> 06:15:42,760
Never mind.

5648
06:15:42,920 --> 06:15:44,520
I was gonna... I was gonna style on them there.

5649
06:15:47,980 --> 06:15:48,680
Get him, Erica!

5650
06:15:49,740 --> 06:15:50,260
Get him!

5651
06:15:53,980 --> 06:15:54,800
Come here.

5652
06:15:56,680 --> 06:15:57,380
Hey!

5653
06:15:58,120 --> 06:15:58,820
Ow!

5654
06:15:59,100 --> 06:15:59,640
I need to eat.

5655
06:16:00,780 --> 06:16:01,240
Eat!

5656
06:16:03,400 --> 06:16:04,500
Oh, creeper.

5657
06:16:04,660 --> 06:16:05,420
Creeper alert.

5658
06:16:07,220 --> 06:16:08,040
Got him.

5659
06:16:10,520 --> 06:16:11,440
Erica, careful!

5660
06:16:13,280 --> 06:16:13,980
Careful!

5661
06:16:17,940 --> 06:16:18,800
Get out.

5662
06:16:20,760 --> 06:16:22,040
No, no, don't explode!

5663
06:16:22,440 --> 06:16:22,840
No!

5664
06:16:25,630 --> 06:16:27,470
No, why did I do that?

5665
06:16:27,750 --> 06:16:28,850
I should have ran!

5666
06:16:29,790 --> 06:16:31,330
I should have fucking ran!

5667
06:16:32,290 --> 06:16:33,430
Are you kidding me?

5668
06:16:34,810 --> 06:16:35,550
Oh, well.

5669
06:16:36,270 --> 06:16:37,410
That sucks, dude.

5670
06:16:37,910 --> 06:16:42,130
I mean... Oh, she didn't have armor on.

5671
06:16:43,310 --> 06:16:44,690
Oh, no.

5672
06:16:46,870 --> 06:16:51,090
I didn't even... It didn't even cross my mind that that would happen right now, man.

5673
06:16:54,870 --> 06:16:55,690
That was stupid.

5674
06:16:56,410 --> 06:16:56,990
Oh well.

5675
06:16:57,510 --> 06:16:58,270
What can you do?

5676
06:16:59,990 --> 06:17:01,710
We still have that one guy I know.

5677
06:17:03,490 --> 06:17:04,570
I gotta find him now.

5678
06:17:09,410 --> 06:17:10,070
Come here, you.

5679
06:17:15,770 --> 06:17:21,930
Just dropped a bunch of end of pearls.

5680
06:17:30,360 --> 06:17:32,540
I cannot believe I just let that happen, man.

5681
06:17:34,720 --> 06:17:35,600
What a bummer.

5682
06:17:35,920 --> 06:17:37,060
Right after I rescue her.

5683
06:17:39,840 --> 06:17:40,280
Shit.

5684
06:17:41,620 --> 06:17:42,340
You know what?

5685
06:17:42,400 --> 06:17:43,880
I'm gonna call my other dog, Erika.

5686
06:17:45,880 --> 06:17:48,460
And pretend that I actually did rescue her and come home with her.

5687
06:17:49,640 --> 06:17:50,820
That is what happened, guys.

5688
06:17:51,540 --> 06:17:54,560
Erika did not die to a creeper explosion.

5689
06:17:54,820 --> 06:17:56,100
It did not take place.

5690
06:17:59,810 --> 06:18:00,590
It didn't.

5691
06:18:01,570 --> 06:18:05,050
Because I will delete that part of the VOD and people will think that that's what happened.

5692
06:18:05,410 --> 06:18:11,650
I will be like, oh, sorry, the footage got lost, you know, digital hit by a cosmic ray or something.

5693
06:18:12,290 --> 06:18:16,150
And a bit got flipped and these things happen, you know.

5694
06:18:16,310 --> 06:18:18,510
But thankfully, Erica was alive.

5695
06:18:18,930 --> 06:18:19,850
She made it home.

5696
06:18:20,630 --> 06:18:21,910
And she's doing great.

5697
06:18:22,010 --> 06:18:24,110
In fact, she's looking over the new house I'm building right now.

5698
06:18:37,880 --> 06:18:38,600
Oh my god.

5699
06:18:40,960 --> 06:18:41,740
That was sick.

5700
06:18:43,240 --> 06:18:45,580
How did I miss all these spots here last time I was here?

5701
06:18:45,680 --> 06:18:47,080
This is unacceptable.

5702
06:18:49,660 --> 06:18:53,800
No wonder things were going slow with the Orphan Crusher.

5703
06:18:54,320 --> 06:18:55,880
I am speeding it up right now.

5704
06:18:59,880 --> 06:19:01,880
Now, let's try and go find the dude I know.

5705
06:19:02,940 --> 06:19:03,760
I know a guy.

5706
06:19:04,060 --> 06:19:05,720
And he's somewhere over there.

5707
06:19:08,560 --> 06:19:09,700
I promise you.

5708
06:19:12,520 --> 06:19:22,340
In fact, I predict I'm gonna... I'm gonna find the guy I know in less than... 11 minutes.

5709
06:19:23,900 --> 06:19:26,360
11 minutes, and I will have found the guy I know.

5710
06:19:29,680 --> 06:19:30,420
You'll see.

5711
06:19:35,940 --> 06:19:37,180
I'm gonna head back up here.

5712
06:19:45,580 --> 06:19:46,860
How do I get back up?

5713
06:19:47,380 --> 06:19:48,220
Ah, cobblestone.

5714
06:20:02,700 --> 06:20:03,540
Here we are.

5715
06:20:07,060 --> 06:20:08,700
Back into the mines we go.

5716
06:20:14,600 --> 06:20:16,180
We are actually running low on food.

5717
06:20:16,580 --> 06:20:17,620
I could take this bread.

5718
06:20:23,820 --> 06:20:27,680
Don't want this or that or this weird stuff.

5719
06:20:27,860 --> 06:20:28,420
No, thank you.

5720
06:20:32,960 --> 06:20:33,640
Yeah, I'm good.

5721
06:20:45,400 --> 06:20:46,440
Okay, not there.

5722
06:20:46,700 --> 06:20:47,860
Why did I do this?

5723
06:20:49,340 --> 06:20:49,860
Lava?

5724
06:20:50,180 --> 06:20:51,320
Oh, that's why I did it.

5725
06:20:54,280 --> 06:20:55,040
Makes sense.

5726
06:20:58,040 --> 06:20:58,800
Dead end.

5727
06:21:05,120 --> 06:21:07,260
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

5728
06:21:08,960 --> 06:21:10,100
I'm in the wrong spot, guys.

5729
06:21:11,660 --> 06:21:12,580
I know where to go.

5730
06:21:14,160 --> 06:21:14,860
Check this out.

5731
06:21:18,100 --> 06:21:19,840
Now to remember the exact entrance.

5732
06:21:20,300 --> 06:21:22,460
Because it was, in fact, the other cave, if you remember.

5733
06:21:22,580 --> 06:21:23,820
One of the first caves I lit.

5734
06:21:35,440 --> 06:21:36,140
Is it higher?

5735
06:21:36,260 --> 06:21:37,340
No, it's not higher than this.

5736
06:21:38,100 --> 06:21:40,720
If anything, it's... Maybe this one.

5737
06:21:42,600 --> 06:21:43,780
Oh no, that doesn't lead anywhere.

5738
06:21:46,880 --> 06:21:47,620
Is it that one?

5739
06:21:48,840 --> 06:21:49,980
Hey, we got some darkness here.

5740
06:21:55,420 --> 06:21:56,220
Oh, damn it.

5741
06:21:57,620 --> 06:21:58,620
Ah, this way probably.

5742
06:22:10,520 --> 06:22:12,080
What was that flashing just there?

5743
06:22:14,020 --> 06:22:16,360
Did I just get a glimpse of something I shouldn't get a glimpse of?

5744
06:22:20,180 --> 06:22:20,540
What?

5745
06:22:20,720 --> 06:22:21,340
Nothing that way.

5746
06:22:30,200 --> 06:22:30,940
I'll head in here.

5747
06:22:32,580 --> 06:22:33,560
That's where I was before.

5748
06:22:34,740 --> 06:22:36,100
Shit, okay, I'm getting a little lost.

5749
06:22:49,660 --> 06:22:50,760
I'm actually trying to hurry.

5750
06:22:58,260 --> 06:22:59,820
I should hit that other cave soon.

5751
06:23:07,270 --> 06:23:08,590
Okay, let's just take it easy.

5752
06:23:08,910 --> 06:23:09,670
Back to the front.

5753
06:23:09,870 --> 06:23:11,090
I need to reorient myself.

5754
06:23:11,990 --> 06:23:14,310
I know exactly where that guy is, by the way.

5755
06:23:14,390 --> 06:23:15,410
I know exactly where he is.

5756
06:23:15,470 --> 06:23:16,210
I just need to get there.

5757
06:23:18,470 --> 06:23:20,750
You may not believe me, but I am telling the truth.

5758
06:23:28,790 --> 06:23:30,150
Now, which one of these was it?

5759
06:23:32,470 --> 06:23:33,630
Could be that one, actually.

5760
06:23:51,180 --> 06:23:51,900
Feather up?

5761
06:23:53,820 --> 06:23:54,300
No.

5762
06:24:00,260 --> 06:24:00,980
Not here.

5763
06:24:10,880 --> 06:24:12,180
Not sure what's going on there.

5764
06:24:16,240 --> 06:24:16,720
Fuck!

5765
06:24:17,020 --> 06:24:17,980
Come on, come on, hurry, hurry!

5766
06:24:18,680 --> 06:24:19,580
I can do this.

5767
06:24:23,300 --> 06:24:24,120
Oh no.

5768
06:24:27,400 --> 06:24:28,860
It's problematic, guys.

5769
06:24:31,900 --> 06:24:32,800
It's not good.

5770
06:24:33,060 --> 06:24:34,060
It doesn't look good.

5771
06:24:34,940 --> 06:24:36,040
It's the wrong spot.

5772
06:24:36,440 --> 06:24:37,280
It's in here.

5773
06:24:39,620 --> 06:24:40,600
It's not in here.

5774
06:24:40,760 --> 06:24:41,220
FUG!

5775
06:24:42,080 --> 06:24:43,240
Fudge, fudge.

5776
06:24:43,940 --> 06:24:45,840
It's a type of food, I think.

5777
06:24:49,440 --> 06:24:50,140
This one.

5778
06:24:50,360 --> 06:24:51,460
This has to be it.

5779
06:24:51,940 --> 06:24:52,460
Right?

5780
06:24:53,820 --> 06:24:55,140
It's so straight and narrow.

5781
06:25:00,300 --> 06:25:01,240
I've been here!

5782
06:25:05,820 --> 06:25:06,740
Oh no.

5783
06:25:18,780 --> 06:25:19,200
This way.

5784
06:25:22,080 --> 06:25:23,160
Okay, there's actually something up here.

5785
06:25:29,540 --> 06:25:30,600
Yeah, yeah, yeah, okay.

5786
06:25:31,200 --> 06:25:31,820
This could be it.

5787
06:25:34,000 --> 06:25:34,980
That's too dark, for sure.

5788
06:25:36,900 --> 06:25:38,000
Hold on, we got some darkness here.

5789
06:25:38,000 --> 06:25:38,720
I gotta take care of it.

5790
06:25:43,830 --> 06:25:45,970
I thought it was raining experience for a moment.

5791
06:25:48,230 --> 06:25:49,530
That confused the hell out of me.

5792
06:26:02,600 --> 06:26:03,000
Okay.

5793
06:26:03,000 --> 06:26:04,000
Guys, I may be lost.

5794
06:26:04,220 --> 06:26:05,120
I may actually be lost.

5795
06:26:07,720 --> 06:26:11,040
I have to come to terms with that.

5796
06:26:11,760 --> 06:26:16,000
In my own time, of course, I will realize what I have done.

5797
06:26:17,880 --> 06:26:18,900
And accept defeat.

5798
06:26:21,500 --> 06:26:22,500
But let me tell you this.

5799
06:26:22,960 --> 06:26:24,140
I know where he is still.

5800
06:26:24,260 --> 06:26:25,020
I know where he is.

5801
06:26:25,160 --> 06:26:27,720
I just need to access the cave from the other side.

5802
06:26:28,080 --> 06:26:29,120
Of the community center.

5803
06:26:29,560 --> 06:26:31,560
You know the one right next to the lake?

5804
06:26:31,880 --> 06:26:34,440
If I enter via there, I can find him in no time.

5805
06:26:34,740 --> 06:26:38,140
I just thought I could remember the path to that cave via here.

5806
06:26:38,320 --> 06:26:40,420
And I didn't want to go all the way out and in again.

5807
06:26:40,640 --> 06:26:41,380
That's all I'm saying.

5808
06:26:44,000 --> 06:26:45,640
I'll prove it to you when I finally get there.

5809
06:26:52,020 --> 06:26:53,280
Oh, I thought I saw a cave here.

5810
06:26:53,460 --> 06:26:54,100
Oh, nice.

5811
06:26:56,220 --> 06:26:56,840
Good shit.

5812
06:26:59,600 --> 06:27:01,200
Guess I'm gonna clear out some darkness.

5813
06:27:02,640 --> 06:27:04,240
Hello darkness, my old friend.

5814
06:27:08,300 --> 06:27:09,640
Wait, there's also stuff up here.

5815
06:27:15,140 --> 06:27:16,620
Ooh, would you look at that now?

5816
06:27:16,760 --> 06:27:17,060
Uh-oh.

5817
06:27:17,980 --> 06:27:19,020
Ah, fuck you.

5818
06:27:19,800 --> 06:27:20,120
Oh god.

5819
06:27:20,380 --> 06:27:20,880
Way too many!

5820
06:27:22,400 --> 06:27:23,420
Just explode, I don't care.

5821
06:27:25,280 --> 06:27:25,820
Thank you.

5822
06:27:27,940 --> 06:27:28,820
Thank you very much.

5823
06:27:29,220 --> 06:27:29,720
Hey, what's that?

5824
06:27:31,460 --> 06:27:31,840
Whoa.

5825
06:27:35,620 --> 06:27:36,000
Alright.

5826
06:27:38,320 --> 06:27:40,660
Look at all these enemies that could have been in the Orphan Crusher.

5827
06:27:47,840 --> 06:27:48,860
Now I want you to kill him.

5828
06:27:49,960 --> 06:27:50,760
Kill him for me.

5829
06:27:52,280 --> 06:27:52,940
Look at that.

5830
06:27:53,040 --> 06:27:54,000
Clever use of game mechanics.

5831
06:27:57,080 --> 06:27:57,520
Idiot.

5832
06:27:58,220 --> 06:27:58,660
Idiot.

5833
06:27:59,580 --> 06:28:00,020
Idiot.

5834
06:28:02,900 --> 06:28:04,020
I got a music disc.

5835
06:28:09,740 --> 06:28:11,220
Not sure I've heard that one before.

5836
06:28:12,240 --> 06:28:12,680
Chirp.

5837
06:28:18,380 --> 06:28:19,700
I like that one.

5838
06:28:25,000 --> 06:28:26,620
And this is too dark.

5839
06:28:27,600 --> 06:28:29,280
Now we have something below us too.

5840
06:28:36,360 --> 06:28:37,120
Skeleton heard?

5841
06:28:39,860 --> 06:28:40,420
Where?

5842
06:28:42,780 --> 06:28:43,840
Are you in here?

5843
06:28:53,780 --> 06:28:54,180
Aha!

5844
06:28:59,560 --> 06:29:01,060
Oh, wait, this is where I was before.

5845
06:29:01,320 --> 06:29:01,400
Ha!

5846
06:29:01,840 --> 06:29:02,240
Right.

5847
06:29:02,840 --> 06:29:03,960
I forgot about this path.

5848
06:29:04,040 --> 06:29:05,260
Actually, good that I came back.

5849
06:29:06,460 --> 06:29:07,500
I'm hearing another skeleton.

5850
06:29:16,570 --> 06:29:17,110
Stop.

5851
06:29:17,350 --> 06:29:18,130
Stop existing.

5852
06:29:19,410 --> 06:29:20,090
Thank you.

5853
06:29:21,410 --> 06:29:23,390
Your non-existence pleases me greatly.

5854
06:29:30,030 --> 06:29:30,890
Okay, nice.

5855
06:29:31,670 --> 06:29:32,770
Another area cleared.

5856
06:29:34,990 --> 06:29:36,250
Very satisfying stuff.

5857
06:29:36,530 --> 06:29:37,650
Man, I'm so sad Erika died.

5858
06:29:37,770 --> 06:29:37,990
Fuck.

5859
06:29:39,730 --> 06:29:41,090
How could I let that happen?

5860
06:29:45,010 --> 06:29:46,590
Honestly, though, it was her or me.

5861
06:29:47,530 --> 06:29:49,190
Where the fuck are you spawning from?

5862
06:29:50,970 --> 06:29:54,210
See, I missed a tiny spot up there, and suddenly they're pouring out.

5863
06:29:59,030 --> 06:29:59,610
Come here.

5864
06:30:00,690 --> 06:30:01,270
Okay, you're dead.

5865
06:30:05,070 --> 06:30:05,590
Got him.

5866
06:30:10,440 --> 06:30:13,620
I even made it up here before and actually placed the torch, but it was not enough!

5867
06:30:17,420 --> 06:30:20,900
Unless they're coming out of... Oh, I need this.

5868
06:30:23,100 --> 06:30:24,500
Coal is sorely needed.

5869
06:30:33,240 --> 06:30:33,720
Dankeschön.

5870
06:30:37,880 --> 06:30:39,620
Are they coming out of the woodwork somehow?

5871
06:30:42,960 --> 06:30:44,660
Or the stonework, I should say.

5872
06:30:46,160 --> 06:30:46,520
Whoa!

5873
06:30:47,080 --> 06:30:48,120
Good thing there was water.

5874
06:30:49,680 --> 06:30:50,880
Could have been problematic.

5875
06:30:59,300 --> 06:31:00,740
Also, I've been going for way too long.

5876
06:31:00,920 --> 06:31:02,840
I need to... I'm actually dying of hunger.

5877
06:31:03,320 --> 06:31:05,180
My stomach has been growling forever.

5878
06:31:06,660 --> 06:31:07,540
I'm gonna stop right here.

5879
06:31:08,040 --> 06:31:09,000
Right in the middle of the cave.

5880
06:31:10,120 --> 06:31:10,920
Middle of the music.

5881
06:31:21,600 --> 06:31:22,400
And there we are.

5882
06:31:27,500 --> 06:31:28,180
Oh, man.

5883
06:31:28,720 --> 06:31:29,300
Break or end?

5884
06:31:29,380 --> 06:31:29,880
This is the end.

5885
06:31:30,160 --> 06:31:31,380
This is the end, Mr. Tanooki.

5886
06:31:32,180 --> 06:31:34,640
I've been going for almost eight hours today.

5887
06:31:35,460 --> 06:31:41,700
Two of those hours, or maybe one and a half, was StarCraft in the beginning, and then I transitioned over to Minecraft after that.

5888
06:31:48,540 --> 06:31:49,360
The end.

5889
06:31:50,280 --> 06:31:54,160
The cave is significant in showing our failures but also our true motivation.

5890
06:31:54,600 --> 06:31:57,080
The cave reveals many things about ourselves.

5891
06:32:00,710 --> 06:32:01,830
Quite the whole today.

5892
06:32:02,050 --> 06:32:02,910
Yeah, dude.

5893
06:32:03,250 --> 06:32:04,250
I killed it.

5894
06:32:05,770 --> 06:32:11,710
Three Elytras, all kinds of goodies that were enchanted and a million other things.

5895
06:32:11,970 --> 06:32:13,030
And Erika.

5896
06:32:13,610 --> 06:32:14,150
Listen.

5897
06:32:14,870 --> 06:32:16,270
She may have died early.

5898
06:32:17,310 --> 06:32:20,810
But those few moments we had together at the end were very precious.

5899
06:32:24,130 --> 06:32:26,590
She died protecting me, which was honorable.

5900
06:32:26,870 --> 06:32:27,390
What a good friend.

5901
06:32:29,810 --> 06:32:31,370
This is my favorite Minecraft stream?

5902
06:32:31,550 --> 06:32:31,850
Really?

5903
06:32:32,710 --> 06:32:34,150
I'm glad you enjoyed it, Izzy.

5904
06:32:38,670 --> 06:32:39,810
Did you make her grave?

5905
06:32:40,130 --> 06:32:40,830
What grave?

5906
06:32:41,010 --> 06:32:41,550
She's alive.

5907
06:32:42,890 --> 06:32:43,830
She made it back.

5908
06:32:44,210 --> 06:32:46,790
I was joking before when I said that she, of course, died.

5909
06:32:47,230 --> 06:32:47,970
She's in the village.

5910
06:32:54,500 --> 06:32:56,680
Well, you know, I rescued her and now she's alive.

5911
06:32:58,480 --> 06:33:00,360
I got a little bit of Erika by my side.

5912
06:33:00,600 --> 06:33:01,520
Yeah, yeah.

5913
06:33:02,860 --> 06:33:03,260
Nice.

5914
06:33:05,080 --> 06:33:06,960
Hey, EZ, thanks for giving out the community sub.

5915
06:33:08,180 --> 06:33:09,380
And thanks to EvilRed.

5916
06:33:12,240 --> 06:33:13,840
You gave one to Aquarelic.

5917
06:33:14,000 --> 06:33:14,580
Hey, that's cool.

5918
06:33:15,220 --> 06:33:15,700
Good job.

5919
06:33:17,920 --> 06:33:18,320
Sinator.

5920
06:33:18,800 --> 06:33:19,080
Minecraft.

5921
06:33:19,380 --> 06:33:19,700
GG.

5922
06:33:20,220 --> 06:33:21,000
Good game, my dude.

5923
06:33:21,160 --> 06:33:21,740
Thanks for subbing.

5924
06:33:22,980 --> 06:33:24,240
And everyone else as well.

5925
06:33:24,380 --> 06:33:25,000
Thank you very much.

5926
06:33:30,960 --> 06:33:32,620
I love how your building skills progressed.

5927
06:33:32,780 --> 06:33:33,640
Your builds are so cozy.

5928
06:33:34,140 --> 06:33:34,720
Are they?

5929
06:33:35,760 --> 06:33:38,780
I want to say the house I made today, the inside was very cozy.

5930
06:33:38,940 --> 06:33:40,580
I think I nailed that part for sure.

5931
06:33:44,420 --> 06:33:46,060
But I'm gonna spoiler you right now.

5932
06:33:46,180 --> 06:33:48,120
Next time, I am gonna replace that roof.

5933
06:33:48,160 --> 06:33:49,520
And I'm gonna make stairs instead.

5934
06:33:50,280 --> 06:33:51,660
Because I've had it to here.

5935
06:33:51,940 --> 06:33:52,700
With slaps.

5936
06:33:53,640 --> 06:33:55,720
I would say I gave slaps a fair chance.

5937
06:33:57,100 --> 06:33:57,780
That's it though.

5938
06:33:57,900 --> 06:33:58,240
No more.

5939
06:34:07,240 --> 06:34:13,340
But hey, we had a big L for slabs today with the roof, but we also had a big W.

5940
06:34:14,560 --> 06:34:17,860
Making bridges is incredible with slabs.

5941
06:34:23,860 --> 06:34:27,080
So all in all, yeah, I guess my opinion didn't change on them today.

5942
06:34:27,260 --> 06:34:28,740
